        text: "If <code>exp &lt; 0</code>, immediately return <code>-1</code>. For <code>exp == 0</code>, return <code>1</code>."
      },
      {
        title: "Logarithmic Exponentiation",
        text: "Compute <code>long half = power(base, exp / 2);</code>. If <code>exp % 2 == 0</code> return <code>half * half</code>; otherwise return <code>base * half * half</code>."
      }
    ],
    sampleCases: [
