Each test case will contain the following inputs:
  First line contains an integer N, denoting the total number of constituencies.
  Second line contains N space separated integers, each representing the party who won the respective constituency.

Constraints:
1 <= T <= 10
1 <= N <= 10^5
1 <= arr[i] <= 10^6

Output Format:
For each test case, print the integer value representing the winning party.`,
