    solution: `import java.util.Scanner;
class Result {
  static int firstUniqueChar(String str) {
    int[] freq = new int[256];
    for (int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {
      freq[str.charAt(i)]++;
    }
    for (int i = 0; i < str.length(); i++) {
      if (freq[str.charAt(i)] == 1) return i;
    }
    return -1;
  }
}
